---
sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Sequence maximum complexity showcase
  accDescr: A user import request crosses a front door and platform, then branches through critical capacity handling, warning and rejection alternatives, parallel worker persistence, and auditing.
  autonumber
  box Front door
    actor User
    participant UI
  end
  box Platform
    participant API
    participant Queue
    participant Worker
  end
  participant Store
  participant Audit

  rect rgba(255, 204, 213, 0.18)
    User->>UI: Upload import file
    activate UI
    UI->>API: POST /imports
    critical Reserve import slot
      API->>Queue: Create job
    option Slot unavailable
      API-->>UI: Retry later
    end

    alt File has warnings
      API-->>UI: Accepted with warnings
      opt User opens detail drawer
        UI->>API: GET /imports/{id}/warnings
        API-->>UI: Warning list
      end
    else File rejected
      API-->>UI: Validation errors
    else File accepted
      par Queue worker
        Queue->>Worker: Dispatch job
        Worker->>Store: Write normalized rows
        Store-->>Worker: Rows committed
      and Audit stream
        API->>Audit: Record receipt
        Audit-->>API: Receipt stored
      end
      Worker-->>Queue: Job complete
      API-->>UI: Import accepted
    end
    deactivate UI
  end
